  "body": "[MSC3772](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3772) augments push rules with additional checks.\r\n\r\nTo implement we need to:\r\n\r\n* [ ] Implement the new push rule condition.\r\n* [ ] Add the additional default push rules:\r\n\t* [ ] `.m.rule.thread_reply_to_me`\r\n\t* [ ] `.m.rule.thread_reply`\r\n\r\nDepends on #11804.",
